r sort genre with a stunning, immersive twist. Whether you prefer the ease of traditional clicks or the tactile thrill of pouring vibrant liquids by hand, this game lets you play your way\u2014just like handling the real thing! But be careful\u2026 drop a bottle, and you might be in for a cleanup!\n\nJourney through various increasingly challenging levels designed to test your logic and creativity. Earn exciting rewards as you progress, and use them to unlock unique decorations and powerful boosters to personalize your experience and enhance your gameplay.\n\nReady to pour, sort, and conquer?", "short_description": "Magic Color Merge Puzzle reimagines the classic color sort genre with a stunning, immersive twist. Whether you prefer the ease of traditional clicks or the tactile thrill of pouring vibrant liquids by hand, this game lets you play your way\u2014just like handling the real thing! But be careful\u2026 drop a bottle, and you might be in for a cleanup!\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.pixelbrainstudio.com/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Pixelbrain Studio", "support_website_url": "http://www.pixelbrainstudio.com/support", "website_url": "http://www.pixelbrainstudio.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "950989689907